    {
      "id": "CJA66afyL85R_3h1N5_IM",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 269.1171875,
      "y": 162.73828125,
      "width": 814.2394409179688,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2105497369,
      "version": 419,
      "versionNonce": 1049704247,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790094927105,
      "created": 1790094732963,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design url shortner\n\nRequirements\n\nfunctional requirments\n- user should be able to create short url by giving long url as input\n    - optional - user should be able to add expiration time\n    - optional - user should be able to give custom alias \n- user should be able to get redirected to the original url when short url is entered",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design url shortner\n\nRequirements\n\nfunctional requirments\n- user should be able to create short url by giving long url as input\n    - optional - user should be able to add expiration time\n    - optional - user should be able to give custom alias \n- user should be able to get redirected to the original url when short url is entered",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "x_UvFuk6JeYzw3o7PKdIT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 299.6363636363637,
      "y": 423.4318181818183,
      "width": 714.279541015625,
      "height": 925,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1913877401,
      "version": 732,
      "versionNonce": 1018900567,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790095922403,
      "created": 1790094940216,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "non functional requirements\n- should be able to redirect to destination with low latency\n- should be highly available , eventual consistency \n- scalable - should be able to handle 1b db rows and 1m active users daily\n- make sure there are no collisions\n\n\nrelationships\n- users\n- urls \n\n\napi\n\npost /getshortURL \n{\n  url: longurl,\n  expiry: date,\nalias: user alias\n}\n\nreturns - {\nstatus: 201,\nshorturl: shorturl\n\n}\n\n\nget /{short-url}\n\nredirect - 302 temporary redirect\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "non functional requirements\n- should be able to redirect to destination with low latency\n- should be highly available , eventual consistency \n- scalable - should be able to handle 1b db rows and 1m active users daily\n- make sure there are no collisions\n\n\nrelationships\n- users\n- urls \n\n\napi\n\npost /getshortURL \n{\n  url: longurl,\n  expiry: date,\nalias: user alias\n}\n\nreturns - {\nstatus: 201,\nshorturl: shorturl\n\n}\n\n\nget /{short-url}\n\nredirect - 302 temporary redirect\n\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
